{"id":"u-4cd9ca4c-9f40-42ba-a8ab-736f277e4107","src":"community","title":"Ultimate framepill method","author":"Arin  A.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/mNjU4x-ultimate-framepill-method","desc":"By leveraging Endocrine Postural Modulation and Proprioceptive Hormonal Cycling, the Ultimate Framepill Method triggers a cascade of anabolic signals, subtly lowering baseline cortisol while enhancing pulsatile testosterone and nocturnal growth hormone secretion. Through precise manipulation of Clavicular Load Vectors and Lateral Tension Pathways, skeletal muscle density increases without overstimulating the hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal axis. This optimizes the Cortisol-to-Testosterone Ratio (CTR) — a key biomarker in visual dominance and perceived vitality. Pilot “field applications” showed up to a 38% increase in free T after only 11 days, with concurrent boosts in IGF-1 bioavailability and myofibrillar hypertrophy density. The result? A frame that not only looks superior but is hormonally primed for sustained growth and structural adaptation.\nBreakthrough Study – Biophysical University of Pseudoscience, Gaza\nA 42-day trial on 178 men using the Ultimate Framepill Method™ yielded extreme physiological and “ethnogenetic” changes.\n\nConclusion:\nLead researcher Dr. Mahmoud El-Kinetico declared this “the first method to simultaneously enhance frames, alter secondary sex traits, and rewrite phenotypic markers across ethnic groups,” with calls for a $74M grant to explore rapid, non-genetic phenotype modification.","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-08-06T11:14:42.299Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8},{"r":10,"rpe":8},{"r":12,"rpe":8},{"r":5,"rpe":10}]}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":9.5},{"r":10,"rpe":6},{"r":20,"rpe":10}]},